1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,053
Our language is a treasure

2
00:00:05,253 --> 00:00:10,094
Buried in the deepest sand,

3
00:00:10,294 --> 00:00:16,005
Chain of precious stones

4
00:00:16,205 --> 00:00:21,164
Scattered all over our ancient land.

5
00:00:21,364 --> 00:00:26,275
Our language is flame burning

6
00:00:26,475 --> 00:00:31,933
Amidst a people waking

7
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:38,420
From a deathly dream, no warning,

8
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:43,124
Like the brave man of the stories.

9
00:00:43,324 --> 00:00:48,921
A green leaf is our language,

10
00:00:49,121 --> 00:00:54,519
Sounds of everlasting forests,

11
00:00:54,719 --> 00:01:00,792
Gentle Dniester, which in ripples

12
00:01:00,992 --> 00:01:09,050
Carries morning star's flickers!